    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>&quot;My Father won't stop from forcing me to continue his 'Supposedly Legal' business! I just want to live a normal life!&quot;</i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119620/extras/4e5e62af8040a14d81fe6e15e3667f93.poster.avif?t=1705302535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119620/extras/4e5e62af8040a14d81fe6e15e3667f93.webm?t=1705302535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119620/extras/4e5e62af8040a14d81fe6e15e3667f93.mp4?t=1705302535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play as Dewi, the Daughter of a rich Palm Oil Mafioso, as she tries to go through College while trying to stop her obsessive father from forcing her to continue his questionably-legal Oil Empire. <br>The game features modern anime-style characters with multiple endings and hidden unlockable character backstories.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactive dialogue system<br></li><li>Immersive NPC Relationship System with many Topics you can ask the characters, and unlock interesting backstories!<br></li><li>Choices matter!<br></li><li>Player Stats that can unlock new choices, or side activities.<br></li><li>Time-locked/Scheduled activities and story progression,</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>&quot;My Father won't stop from forcing me to continue his 'Supposedly Legal' business! I just want to live a normal life!&quot;</i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119620/extras/4e5e62af8040a14d81fe6e15e3667f93.poster.avif?t=1705302535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119620/extras/4e5e62af8040a14d81fe6e15e3667f93.webm?t=1705302535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119620/extras/4e5e62af8040a14d81fe6e15e3667f93.mp4?t=1705302535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play as Dewi, the Daughter of a rich Palm Oil Mafioso, as she tries to go through College while trying to stop her obsessive father from forcing her to continue his questionably-legal Oil Empire. <br>The game features modern anime-style characters with multiple endings and hidden unlockable character backstories.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactive dialogue system<br></li><li>Immersive NPC Relationship System with many Topics you can ask the characters, and unlock interesting backstories!<br></li><li>Choices matter!<br></li><li>Player Stats that can unlock new choices, or side activities.<br></li><li>Time-locked/Scheduled activities and story progression,</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Management and life-simulation Game with elaborate Relationships, where players manage their character\u2019s actions and activities as they explore topics about self-discovery, parent-children relationships, friendships, and growing up as a College Student.",
